  "id": 1286,
  "description": "Please join our discord for guides, giveaways, or just chatting with members!\n            **Rules for all**\n1. Just enjoy the game and remember it&#039;s just a game\n2. There&#039;s no pressure here, real life comes first. Everyone has a busy schedule\n3. If someone wants to participate in raid, let us know so we can discuss it and see if and when we can schedule it\n4. We won&#039;t give you anything, but we will show and help you obtain it\n5. Yes there&#039;s a leader, but we all get a say! We will hear your input and decide accordingly.\n6. We do have Discord if you would like to chat members, need help, or anything else, but it isn&#039;t mandatory. If not, then comment at the bottom of members&#039; profile\n7. Donate, it doesn&#039;t matter how much or what it is. If we end up with more than we need of something, we will make it known.\n8. Kicked after 2 weeks of inactivity",
